Subject: [PATCH] Publish synchronous NativeUfs boot checkpoints

Source: pinned UniXNU/ShengUfs NativeUfs.cpp after device patches 0001,
0002 and 0004. Reuses the TB710FU SourceStorage text checkpoint provider.

The 2026-11-20 device photo ends at ss-ufs-s. The existing printf probes
only reach the capture ring until the display worker refreshes it. Draw
the entry footer before the first printf or provider access, and refresh
the captured text before operations that can stop boot progress. The
queue ownership checkpoint covers the transition from firmware queue
stop through replacement queue start. It draws before that transition.

The optional weak import preserves the standalone archive path. Every
label fits the eight-character footer. Remove the trace-only extra
provider cast and four extra controller reads introduced by 0004. The
original short-circuit gate and controller diagnostics still execute
under their original conditions.

Verification: tools/check_ufs_bringup_trace.py applies the full series,
checks the footer labels and strips the traces and checkpoints to
compare against post-0002. The original MMIO read and provider cast
sites are checked separately.
